VIP Baskets
=20



            Giving gifts increases your opportunity for repeat business =
and helps build long term relationships. Sending VIP Gift Baskets this =
holiday season and for special occasions year round will show your =
customers how much you appreciate them. Our impressive surprise packages =
are full of great tasting goodies that will make them remember you long =
after the last bite has been enjoyed. Shopping has never been so easy! =
We deliver, ship and take MasterCard and VISA. Call Jewel Dyer at VIP =
Baskets

(816)525-4695.=20

=20

